Implement TopoSort in toposort.go using Kahn's BFS algorithm.

func TopoSort(n int, edges [][2]int) ([]int, bool)
  // edges[i] = [from, to] (directed edge from -> to)
  // Returns (order, true) if no cycle, (nil, false) if cycle detected.
  // Kahn's algorithm:
  //   1. Compute in-degree for each node.
  //   2. Enqueue all nodes with in-degree 0.
  //   3. BFS: dequeue node, add to order, decrement neighbors' in-degree;
  //      enqueue any neighbor whose in-degree reaches 0.
  //   4. If len(order) != n, a cycle exists.

All 5 tests in toposort_test.go must pass.
Run: go test ./...
